# WIC-1963: the drizzle migration journal is generated from the .sql files, not
# committed — it is the shared mutable file every migration PR used to conflict
# on. `db:migrate` regenerates it in-process; `db:journal` writes it explicitly.
packages/api/src/db/migrations/meta/_journal.json
